		"change": "subsidies-as-casetype",
		"adr": "ADR-044 unified-case — subsidy applications fold into the unified case model as the 'subsidie' caseType (seeded in lib/Settings/bezwaar_seed_data.json, uuid b3c1a000-0000-4000-a000-0000000005ab). The bespoke subsidieAanvraag index is replaced by a Cases index pre-filtered to that caseType. subsidieAanvraag remains a SUPPORTING schema linked to the case (case.$ref via subsidieAanvraag.case) carrying the subsidy-specific detail (regeling, requested/granted amount, begroting, beschikking); the case carries the common workflow/status. subsidieRegeling stays a config register surfaced under settings. The SubsidieDetail route + subsidieAanvraag schema stay registered for deep links to the linked detail data.",
		"data-model-decision": "Option (b) — linked detail schema. subsidieAanvraag already declares a `case` property ($ref:case, onDelete:SET_NULL), so subsidy cases use the generic `case` workflow while subsidy-specific fields live on the linked subsidieAanvraag record. The `case` schema is NOT bloated with subsidy-only properties."
	},
	"menu": [
		{
			"id": "SubsidiesGroup",
			"route": "Subsidies"
		},
		{
			"id": "Subsidieregelingen",
			"label": "Subsidieregelingen",
			"icon": "icon-settings",
			"route": "Subsidieregelingen",
			"order": 96
		}
	],
	"pages": [
		{
			"id": "Subsidies",
			"route": "/subsidies",
			"type": "index",
			"title": "Subsidies",
			"config": {
				"register": "procest",
				"schema": "case",
				"filter": {
					"caseType": "b3c1a000-0000-4000-a000-0000000005ab"
				},
				"showViewAction": false,
				"actions": [
					{
						"id": "view",
						"label": "View",
						"icon": "icon-info",
						"handler": "navigate",
						"route": "CaseDetail",
						"type": "handler"
					}
				],
				"columns": [
					"identifier",
					"title",
					{
						"key": "status",
						"label": "Status",
						"formatter": "statusTypeName"
					},
					"assignee",
					"deadline"
				],
				"sidebar": {
					"enabled": true,
					"showMetadata": true
				},
				"documentationUrl": "https://procest.conduction.nl"
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "SubsidieDetail",
			"route": "/subsidies/:id",
			"type": "detail",
			"title": "Subsidie",
			"config": {
				"register": "procest",
				"schema": "subsidieAanvraag",
				"sidebarTabs": [
					{
						"id": "beschikking",
						"label": "Beschikking",
						"icon": "icon-toggle",
						"component": "CaseDecisionsTab",
						"order": 20
					},
					{
						"id": "documents",
						"label": "Bewijsstukken",
						"icon": "icon-files",
						"component": "CaseDocumentsTab",
						"order": 30
					}
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "Subsidieregelingen",
			"route": "/subsidieregelingen",
			"type": "index",
			"title": "Subsidieregelingen",
			"config": {
				"register": "procest",
				"schema": "subsidieRegeling",
				"columns": [
					"regelingNaam",
					"juridischeGrondslag",
					"plafond",
					"tussenrapportageFrequentie",
					"looptijdStart",
					"looptijdEind"
				],
				"sidebar": {
					"enabled": true,
					"showMetadata": true
				}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "Terugvorderingen",
			"route": "/terugvorderingen",
			"type": "index",
			"title": "Terugvorderingen",
			"config": {
				"register": "procest",
				"schema": "terugvordering",
				"columns": [
					"terugvorderingsnummer",
					"bedrag",
					"betaaldBedrag",
					"betaaltermijnEinde",
					"status"
				],
				"sidebar": {
					"enabled": true,
					"showMetadata": true
				}
			}
		}
	]
}
